(7308788, 1140744, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Reminds me of the German flag, but upside down.<br/>I would have lowered the horizon a bit. I usually bitch against centered horizons, but this time that is not the reason for the comment. The details in the foreground are virtually inexistent and pretty uninteresting compared to the lovely colors of the sky. As such they shouldn''t occupy that much space.</td>', 'Nice colors. Reminds me of the German flag, but upside down.I would have lowered the horizon a bit. I usually bitch against centered horizons, but this time that is not the reason for the comment. The details in the foreground are virtually inexistent and pretty uninteresting compared to the lovely colors of the sky. As such they shouldn''t occupy that much space.', '2015-02-01 06:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308789, 1140577, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice play of light, shadow and framing. <br/>I would have placed myself a bit further to the left to enhance the symmetry in the composition.</td>', 'Nice play of light, shadow and framing. I would have placed myself a bit further to the left to enhance the symmetry in the composition.', '2015-02-01 06:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
