(7313578, 1140765, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is something I think of a a semi-abstract and I do a lot of them myself.  Not unidentifiable, but the point of the image is an exploration of the shapes, colors and textures, rather than capturing a scene. I''m not sure they are highly appreciated by the DPC collective, however. Nicely done. 7</td>', 'This is something I think of a a semi-abstract and I do a lot of them myself.  Not unidentifiable, but the point of the image is an exploration of the shapes, colors and textures, rather than capturing a scene. I''m not sure they are highly appreciated by the DPC collective, however. Nicely done. 7', '2015-02-07 11:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7313579, 1140569, 83313, '<td valign="top">This shot brought a question to my mind, that is probably nothing like what you are trying to convey. Are there any drivers that respect crosswalks? I don''t trust drivers to even notice them, nonetheless yield to me while in one. But I also ride a bicycle, so I know I am invisible.</td>', 'This shot brought a question to my mind, that is probably nothing like what you are trying to convey. Are there any drivers that respect crosswalks? I don''t trust drivers to even notice them, nonetheless yield to me while in one. But I also ride a bicycle, so I know I am invisible.', '2015-02-07 11:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
