(7314043, 1139799, 94815, '<td valign="top">I love this shot for the tonality, texture contrasts, and color. Sadly, the crop disappoints my eye because I feel a missing impact which could be amplified by framing more precisely - one that relates the lines and shapes intimately with the frame. I see a square crop with the upper and lower edges as they are. The right edge needs to be moved in touching the right of the lavender shape in the upper right corner. The left edge is more flexible but I vote for a square crop with the other three edges fixed. Try it please. Maybe you were going for a rule of thirds comp but there are more things at work in something as well considered as this sensuous creation. Lest you have any doubt, I''m giving this an 8 because it''s the best in the challenge, although it could have been a 10.</td>', 'I love this shot for the tonality, texture contrasts, and color. Sadly, the crop disappoints my eye because I feel a missing impact which could be amplified by framing more precisely - one that relates the lines and shapes intimately with the frame. I see a square crop with the upper and lower edges as they are. The right edge needs to be moved in touching the right of the lavender shape in the upper right corner. The left edge is more flexible but I vote for a square crop with the other three edges fixed. Try it please. Maybe you were going for a rule of thirds comp but there are more things at work in something as well considered as this sensuous creation. Lest you have any doubt, I''m giving this an 8 because it''s the best in the challenge, although it could have been a 10.', '2015-02-07 23:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
